         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introdução\n\nNesta aula vamos aprender a tabuada do seis (6).\n\nEsta tabuada tem uma característica que já vimos na tabuada do quatro: podemos multiplicar os valores de tabuadas que já conhecemos por um número e obter a nova tabuada. Por isso, ela não é completamente nova para nós.\n\nVamos seguir este caminho juntos e ver como a tabuada do seis cresce.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "4484c9e7-6eb3-48c5-a831-a20b0b1421a1",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "4484c9e7-6eb3-48c5-a831-a20b0b1421a1",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "600c0c57-4120-478f-b5fa-66e7ecb6372d",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=600c0c57-4120-478f-b5fa-66e7ecb6372d",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### As Flores\n\nUm dos lugares da natureza onde podemos ver um padrão crescendo de seis em seis são as flores. Algumas flores têm exatamente seis pétalas, por isso suas pétalas formam grupos naturais de seis.\n\nUma flor tem 6 pétalas. Duas flores têm 6 + 6 = 12 pétalas. Três flores têm 6 + 6 + 6 = 18 pétalas. Cada nova flor acrescenta mais 6 pétalas: 6, 12, 18, 24, 30...",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"imgcenterresponsive\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 230\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Uma flor com seis pétalas ao redor do seu centro amarelo\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#f8bbd0\" stroke=\"#ad1457\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 1</b>: Uma flor com seis pétalas ao redor do seu centro. Cada pétala é uma unidade do nosso grupo de seis.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"imgcenterresponsive\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 240\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cinco flores de cores diferentes, cada uma com seis pétalas\"><g><g transform=\"translate(-120 0)\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#f8bbd0\" stroke=\"#ad1457\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(10 0)\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#bbdefb\" stroke=\"#1565c0\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(140 0)\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#ffe0b2\" stroke=\"#ef6c00\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(270 0)\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#e1bee7\" stroke=\"#6a1b9a\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(400 0)\"><g stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M180 110 L180 216\"/><path d=\"M180 170 Q148 152 136 168 Q156 188 180 182\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/><path d=\"M180 190 Q212 172 224 188 Q204 206 180 202\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\"/></g><g fill=\"#c8e6c9\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"3\"><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(60 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(120 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(180 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(240 180 110)\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"78\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"32\" transform=\"rotate(300 180 110)\"/></g><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"110\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ffe082\" stroke=\"#f57f17\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g></g></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 2</b>: Cinco flores de cores diferentes, cada uma com seis pétalas.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
